OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will begin dry and
OL,6,Fbright with sunny spells. Cloud will
OL,7,Fspread east through the morning with
OL,8,Frain reaching the Western Isles later.
OL,9,FThe rain will continue slowly east
OL,10,Fthrough the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mostly cloudy evening with
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain in the west. The
OL,14,Frain will continue east, to all except
OL,15,Fthe southeast, overnight.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FDry in the east at first
OL,18,Fotherwise rain in the north and the
OL,19,Fwest in the morning will become patchy
OL,20,Fand lighter as it spreads southeast in
OL,21,Fthe afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
