OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMost
OL,6,Fplaces dry, bright but patchy light
OL,7,Frain west and north Sunday, moves to
OL,8,Fthe north Monday and north and east
OL,9,FTuesday.
